Version where the inner product is replaced by a general sesquilinear form `M`. -/
theorem integral_sesq_fourier_fourier (f : 𝓢(V, E)) (g : 𝓢(V, F)) (M : E →L⋆[ℂ] F →L[ℂ] G) :
